        "client_msg_id": "b5fc8b20-ff7c-4f96-8cd3-07a628d0015e",
        "text": "Also from Lisa:\n\n&gt; This is after I contacted Dr. Bob Gould at PSR along with the Ploughshares people today:\n&gt; Julie Lindow &lt;<mailto:jujulindow@yahoo.com|jujulindow@yahoo.com>&gt;\n&gt; to Marj, Robert, me\n&gt; Hi Lisa,\n&gt; I want to thank you and your reporters for this extremely important series. We posted it on our social accounts yesterday and will continue to promote this series. Also, I made a small personal donation in support of this project.\n&gt; Also, please add me to your email list and let me know if there are other resources, events, ops for us to promote.\n&gt; With gratitude, Julie\n&gt; *<https:\/\/www.sfbaypsr.org\/|SF Bay Physicians for Social ><http:\/\/Responsibility.org|Responsibility.org>*\n&gt; Director of Communications and Health Professional Engagement\n&gt; <http:\/\/JulieLindow.com|JulieLindow.com>\n&gt;  <tel:4157104991|415-710-4991>\n&gt; “Action is the antidote to despair.”",
