                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": ">\nto Marj, Robert, me\nHi Lisa,\nI want to thank you and your reporters for this extremely important series. We posted it on our social accounts yesterday and will continue to promote this series. Also, I made a small personal donation in support of this project.\nAlso, please add me to your email list and let me know if there are other resources, events, ops for us to promote.\nWith gratitude, Julie\n"
